\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Ranking runs by the CIFAR-100 accuracy they will lose: $|\rho |$ over all core runs, at the end of training (dark) and after one epoch (light). Bars are missing where a signal has no epoch-1 counterpart. $^{*}$not label-free: the labelled probe needs a slice of the benchmark, the learning rate is a setting rather than a measurement. Read across configurations like this, the attention statistics are mid-pack and the \emph  {signed} entropy change is near-useless --- but see the text for the reversal within a fixed configuration.}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:predictors}{{2}{5}{Ranking runs by the CIFAR-100 accuracy they will lose: $|\rho |$ over all core runs, at the end of training (dark) and after one epoch (light). Bars are missing where a signal has no epoch-1 counterpart. $^{*}$not label-free: the labelled probe needs a slice of the benchmark, the learning rate is a setting rather than a measurement. Read across configurations like this, the attention statistics are mid-pack and the \emph {signed} entropy change is near-useless --- but see the text for the reversal within a fixed configuration}{figure.2}{}}
